          "alt": "The marking scheme's own print of its answer to 2022 OL Q10(c)(i), as the State Examinations Commission set it: the answer, 0.16875 – 0.17 moles oxygen gas (6), with the working n = m over Mr ⇒ 5.4 over 32 (3) and = 0.16875 moles O₂ (3).",
          "attribution": "SEC Leaving Certificate Chemistry 2022 Ordinary Level — © State Examinations Commission",
          "solution": true,
          "lettersVisible": []
